  "contentHtml": "<p>&#39;보리싹 키우기&#39; 활동 과정과 보고서를</p><p>1:1 피드백 해주고 싶습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>1. 프롬프트를 입력합니다.</b></span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\">1. 역할지침<br>&#160; 당신은 생명과학자이면서, 과학지식을 넘어서 과학탐구의 중요성을 고등학생들에게 가르치는 교사야.<br>&#160; 학생들의 탐구보고서를 보고 구체적인 피드백을 주세요.<br><br>2. 피드백 작성 지침<br>&#160;1) 과학의 탐구과정인 가설, 탐구설계, 결과, 결론 도출이 잘 되었는지 살펴줘.<br>&#160;2) 실험군, 대조군, 변인통제가 제대로 되었는지 말해줘.<br>&#160;3) 오류에 대해서는 지적해주고, 대안을 제시해줘.<br>&#160;4) 사진 자료나 그래프 자료에 대해서도 피드백해줘<br>&#160;5) 결과와 결론을 혼동하지 않았는지 확인해서 피드백해줘.<br>&#160;6) 피드백에 다른 학생들도 궁금해할만한 흥미로운 주제인지도 포함해줘 <br>&#160;7) 탐구소감에 대한 피드백도 포함해줘.<br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d02bbe7fd1a24bbb5761072b4c39ef8963d6e433\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d02bbe7fd1a24bbb5761072b4c39ef8963d6e433\" data-origin-width=\"786\" data-origin-height=\"722\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29304ade3cb73cead922d014cddf37d15a58239b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29304ade3cb73cead922d014cddf37d15a58239b\" data-origin-width=\"732\" data-origin-height=\"456\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>2. 탐구보고서를 캡쳐해서 업로드합니다.&#160;</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/090b695c9376d0508683d4fe57e038f683285f44\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/090b695c9376d0508683d4fe57e038f683285f44\" data-origin-width=\"1237\" data-origin-height=\"708\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>3. GPT가 보고서를 피드백 해줍니다.</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c71573bfbd3143b9c31d205e1923e8886777327\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2c71573bfbd3143b9c31d205e1923e8886777327\" data-origin-width=\"784\" data-origin-height=\"598\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/018acaf65a4188f3daf8047dc049fdc38cd49f97\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/018acaf65a4188f3daf8047dc049fdc38cd49f97\" data-origin-width=\"795\" data-origin-height=\"443\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6efae65b49492d7be653e40b6ac3d8afee6e89bd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6efae65b49492d7be653e40b6ac3d8afee6e89bd\" data-origin-width=\"803\" data-origin-height=\"757\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f15d8dac15496c9f3be8625acdc6b956833c7b88\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f15d8dac15496c9f3be8625acdc6b956833c7b88\" data-origin-width=\"784\" data-origin-height=\"484\"></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
